# Zero-width rules fire before any pattern is tried: a consuming rule
# live only where one of them fires never matches.
# error: lexer_shadowed_by_zero_width.grammar:11:1:
# error: this rule can never match: whenever its guards hold, the zero-width rule on line 10 fires first
@lexer
state
    m = 0
tokens
    t, z, c, eof, err
@ m                             → z, {m = 0}
'a' @ m                         → t
'a'                             → c
.                               → err

@parser
top! = ERR → 1
